C BY-NC 4.0","attribution":"https://tatoeba.org/user/profile/GlossaMatik"},{"id":13829038,"zh":"请将这本书带在身边。","pinyin":"qing3 jiang1 zhe4 ben3 shu1 dai4 zai4 shen1 bian1","en":"Don't forget your ticket.","sv":"","audio":"1284518.mp3","author":"zhoucantd","licence":"CC BY-NC 4.0","attribution":"https://tatoeba.org/user/profile/zhoucantd"},{"id":13843232,"zh":"我学习道本语很久了。","pinyin":"wo3 xue2 xi2 dao4 ben3 yu3 hen3 jiu3 le5","en":"I've been studying Toki Pona for a long time.","sv":"","audio":"1284525.mp3","author":"zhoucantd","licence":"CC BY-NC 4.0","attribution":"https://tatoeba.org/user/profile/zhoucantd"},{"id":13827604,"zh":"我是这么想象出来它的。","pinyin":"wo3 shi4 zhe4 me5 xiang3 xiang4 chu1 lai2 ta1 de5","en":"That's how I imagine it.","sv":"","audio":"1284514.mp3","author":"zhoucantd","licence":"CC BY-NC 4.0","attribution":"https://tatoeba.org/user/profile/zhoucantd"},{"id":13829034,"zh":"请在天黑之前给我打电话。","pinyin":"qing3 zai4 tian1 hei1 zhi1 qian2 gei3 wo3 da3 dian4 hua4","en":"Call me this afternoon.","sv":"","audio":"1284517.mp3","author":"zhoucantd","licence":"CC BY-NC 4.0","attribution":"https://tatoeba.org/user/profile/zhoucantd"},{"id":13829048,"zh":"我很高兴能向你提供帮助。","pinyin":"wo3 hen3 gao1 xing4 neng2 xiang4 ni3 ti2 gong1 bang1 zhu4","en":"","sv":"","audio":"1284521.mp3","author":"zhoucantd","licence":"CC BY-NC 4.0","attribution":"https://tatoeba.org/user/profile/zhoucantd"},{"id":13829095,"zh":"为什么你觉得老鼠很可爱？","pinyin":"wei4 shen2 me5 ni3 jue2 de5 lao3 shu3 hen3 ke3 ai4","en":"Why do you think mice are cute?","sv":"","audio":"1284522.mp3","author":"zhoucantd","licence":"CC BY-NC 4.0","attribution":"https://tatoeba.org/user/profile/zhoucantd"},{"id":13839529,"zh":"编辑维基百科使我感觉在帮助全人类。","pinyin":"bian1 ji2 wei2 ji1 bai3 ke1 shi3 wo3 gan3 jue2 zai4 bang1 zhu4 quan2 ren2 lei4","en":"","sv":"","audio":"1284523.mp3","author":"zhoucantd","licence":"CC BY-NC 4.0","attribution":"https://tatoeba.org/user/profile/zhoucantd"}]